# Fast gate before any scoring run. Curated canaries: every wrong-answer
# fix adds one here (CLAUDE.md).
#
# The property is explicit on every line. These entries were curated one
# property at a time; letting a task expand to every property it declares
# doubled the runtime and changed what the gate covers.
